# Ground item spawns of mapsquare (45,55).
# Death Plateau's five stone balls by the equipment room's stone mechanism in Burthorpe Castle:
# 289's spawns (m45_55.jm2). The 2011 wiki (Death Plateau) still has them there: "head back to the
# castle ... and you'll see some stone balls on the ground. Pick up the 5 stones (one of each
# colour)". It names no tile, so the tiles are 289's; cache 786's map has the mechanism beside them
# on 289's tiles.
0 13 41: death_cannonball_yellow 1
0 13 42: death_cannonball_green 1
0 13 43: death_cannonball_purple 1
0 13 44: death_cannonball_blue 1
0 13 45: death_cannonball_red 1
